@startuml
title 企业文件管理系统 - 文件浏览与搜索时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器/文件列表页\n(files/List.vue)" as UI
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "文件控制器\nFileController" as FileCtrl
participant "文件服务\nFileService" as FileSvc
database "FileRepository\n(MySQL)" as DB

== 列表 ==
User -> UI: 打开页面/刷新
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/list\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>\n[folderId?]
Axios -> FileCtrl: getUserFiles(folderId)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: getUserFiles(userId, folderId)
alt 根目录
  FileSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndFolderIsNullAndDeletedFalseOrderByCreateTimeDesc
else 指定文件夹
  FileSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndFolderIdAndDeletedFalseOrderByCreateTimeDesc
end
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 [File...]
Axios --> UI: 渲染列表

== 搜索 ==
User -> UI: 输入关键字并搜索
UI -> Axios: GET /api/files/search?keyword=...\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
Axios -> FileCtrl: searchFiles(keyword)
FileCtrl -> SecurityContext: 获取 userId
FileCtrl -> FileSvc: searchFiles(userId, keyword)
FileSvc -> DB: findByUserIdAndOriginalFilenameContainingAndDeletedFalseOrderByCreateTimeDesc
FileCtrl --> Axios: 200 [File...]
Axios --> UI: 显示搜索结果

@enduml

